   "trans": "the dewy feathers gleam white with a glistening bloom",
   "body": "The wings are painted in light and moisture: <em>roscidae</em> (\"dewy\"), <em>candicant</em> (\"gleam white\"), <em>micanti flore</em> (\"with a sparkling bloom\"). The downy feathers are made to shimmer like petals wet with dew.",
   "exam": "<strong>In an exam:</strong> \"The wing-description layers whiteness, dew and sparkle (<em>roscidae ... candicant ... micanti flore</em>) into a shimmering image, the floral metaphor <em>flore</em> lending the feathers a delicate, living beauty.\"",
